### Task 3 Organization Setup Walkthrough
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Login as Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

### Store token from login response
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Update Company Settings (Admin Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "HCM Lite Technologies Inc.",
  "officeStart": "09:00",
  "graceMinutes": 15,
  "halfDayHours": 4.5,
  "weekendDays": [0, 6],
  "timezone": "Asia/Karachi",
  "office": {
    "lat": 24.8607,
    "lng": 67.0011,
    "radiusMeters": 250
  }
}

### 3. View Settings (Public View for any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings/public
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Apply Suggested Leave Types (Admin Only)
# Seeds 4 standard types: annual (14), casual (10), sick (8), unpaid (unlimited)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave-types/apply-suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Create a Department (Admin Only)
# @name createDepartment
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Engineering",
  "code": "ENG",
  "description": "Software development and infrastructure"
}

@departmentId = {{createDepartment.response.body.data._id}}

### 6. Create a Designation linked to Department (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/designations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Software Engineer",
  "departmentId": "{{departmentId}}",
  "level": "L4"
}

### 7. Create a Public Holiday (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/holidays
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pakistan Day",
  "date": "2026-03-23"
}

### 8. Create an HR User (Admin Only)
# Returns a temporary password exactly once
# @name createHr
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah Connor",
  "email": "sarah.hr@example.com"
}

@hrTempPassword = {{createHr.response.body.data.tempPassword}}

### 9. Check Organization Setup Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/org/readiness
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
